media: rc: keymaps: the H713 projectors' stock IR remote, and its map on the HY310

The stock remote of the HY310 and the HY300PRO-G-EU sends NEC with the
customer code 0xfd02; the table is the vendor's customer_ir_fd02.kl. Until
now the receiver had rc-empty, so no IR key reached the input layer (TODO
2.35); with this map h713-power sees KEY_POWER from the remote as from the
key on the device, and the volume, mute, focus and navigation keys reach
userspace (h713-keys). The Linux names follow the Bluetooth side of the
same remote (0169): Home KEY_HOMEPAGE, focus up KEY_F4, focus down KEY_F5.
Seven navigation keys were checked on the HY300PRO-G-EU (doku/138); the
HY310's tree names the map, which the HY200 QZ713DF A1's tree includes.

